msgid "1. Before the Interview"
msgstr "1. Before the Interview"

msgid "2-3 short stories about your achievements."
msgstr "2-3 short stories about your achievements."

msgid "2. Common Questions and Better Answers"
msgstr "2. Common Questions and Better Answers"

msgid "3. During the Interview"
msgstr "3. During the Interview"

msgid "4. Questions You Should Ask"
msgstr "4. Questions You Should Ask"

msgid "5. After the Interview"
msgstr "5. After the Interview"

msgid "6. Final Interview Day Checklist"
msgstr "6. Final Interview Day Checklist"

msgid "Arrive 10-15 minutes early for in-person interviews."
msgstr "Arrive 10-15 minutes early for in-person interviews."

msgid "Career Advice"
msgstr "Career Advice"

msgid "Connect your strengths to the role requirements and explain why this company fits your goals."
msgstr "Connect your strengths to the role requirements and explain why this company fits your goals."

msgid "Describe a challenge you faced"
msgstr "Describe a challenge you faced"

msgid "Examples of teamwork and problem-solving."
msgstr "Examples of teamwork and problem-solving."

msgid "Follow-up Message"
msgstr "Follow-up Message"

msgid "For online calls, test camera, sound, and internet in advance."
msgstr "For online calls, test camera, sound, and internet in advance."

msgid "How is performance measured for this role?"
msgstr "How is performance measured for this role?"

msgid "I checked logistics or technical setup."
msgstr "I checked logistics or technical setup."

msgid "I practiced short and clear introductions."
msgstr "I practiced short and clear introductions."

msgid "I prepared 3 achievement examples."
msgstr "I prepared 3 achievement examples."

msgid "I prepared at least 2 questions for the interviewer."
msgstr "I prepared at least 2 questions for the interviewer."

msgid "I reviewed the company and role details."
msgstr "I reviewed the company and role details."

msgid "Interview Preparation for Real-World Jobs"
msgstr "Interview Preparation for Real-World Jobs"

msgid "Keep it structured: who you are, what you have done, and what you are looking for next."
msgstr "Keep it structured: who you are, what you have done, and what you are looking for next."

msgid "Keep your tone respectful, calm, and confident."
msgstr "Keep your tone respectful, calm, and confident."

msgid "Listen carefully and answer directly."
msgstr "Listen carefully and answer directly."

msgid "Main responsibilities in the job description."
msgstr "Main responsibilities in the job description."

msgid "Note what went well and what to improve for your next interview. This helps you get stronger with each attempt."
msgstr "Note what went well and what to improve for your next interview. This helps you get stronger with each attempt."

msgid "Prepare for interviews across all industries with clear steps you can apply to office, field, customer-facing, and operational roles."
msgstr "Prepare for interviews across all industries with clear steps you can apply to office, field, customer-facing, and operational roles."

msgid "Questions to ask the interviewer."
msgstr "Questions to ask the interviewer."

msgid "Research Checklist"
msgstr "Research Checklist"

msgid "Self-Review"
msgstr "Self-Review"

msgid "Send a short thank-you note within 24 hours to confirm your interest and professionalism."
msgstr "Send a short thank-you note within 24 hours to confirm your interest and professionalism."

msgid "Shift/work schedule expectations."
msgstr "Shift/work schedule expectations."

msgid "Strong preparation helps you answer confidently and show genuine interest in the position."
msgstr "Strong preparation helps you answer confidently and show genuine interest in the position."

msgid "Tell me about yourself"
msgstr "Tell me about yourself"

msgid "Tip:"
msgstr "Tip:"

msgid "Use a practical example with your actions and final outcome, preferably with a measurable result."
msgstr "Use a practical example with your actions and final outcome, preferably with a measurable result."

msgid "Use specific examples, not only general statements."
msgstr "Use specific examples, not only general statements."

msgid "Use STAR format: Situation, Task, Action, Result. It keeps answers clear and professional."
msgstr "Use STAR format: Situation, Task, Action, Result. It keeps answers clear and professional."

msgid "What are the main day-to-day responsibilities?"
msgstr "What are the main day-to-day responsibilities?"

msgid "What are the next steps in the hiring process?"
msgstr "What are the next steps in the hiring process?"

msgid "What does success look like in the first 3 months?"
msgstr "What does success look like in the first 3 months?"

msgid "What the company does and who its customers are."
msgstr "What the company does and who its customers are."

msgid "What to Prepare"
msgstr "What to Prepare"

msgid "Why do you want this role?"
msgstr "Why do you want this role?"

msgid "Work model: on-site, hybrid, or remote."
msgstr "Work model: on-site, hybrid, or remote."

msgid "Your reasons for applying to this role."
msgstr "Your reasons for applying to this role."
